#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"I<OPTIONS> := { B<-V>[I<ersion>] | B<-h>[I<uman-readable>] | B<-"
"s>[I<tatistics>] | B<-d>[I<etails>] | B<-r>[I<esolve>] | B<-iec> | B<-"
"f>[I<amily>] { B<inet> | B<inet6> | B<link> } | B<-4> | B<-6> | B<-B> | "
"B<-0> | B<-l>[I<oops>] { B<maximum-addr-flush-attempts> } | B<-o>[I<neline>] "
"| B<-rc>[I<vbuf>] [B<size>] | B<-t>[I<imestamp>] | B<-ts>[I<hort>] | B<-"
"n>[I<etns>] name | B<-N>[I<umeric>] | B<-a>[I<ll>] | B<-c>[I<olor>] | B<-"
"br>[I<ief>] | B<-j>[son] | B<-p>[retty] }"
msgstr ""
"I<OPTIONS> := { B<-V>[I<ersion>] | B<-h>[I<uman-readable>] | B<-"
"s>[I<tatistics>] | B<-d>[I<etails>] | B<-r>[I<esolve>] | B<-iec> | B<-"
"f>[I<amily>] { B<inet> | B<inet6> | B<link> } | B<-4> | B<-6> | B<-B> | "
"B<-0> | B<-l>[I<oops>] { B<maximum-addr-flush-attempts> } | B<-o>[I<neline>] "
"| B<-rc>[I<vbuf>] [B<size>] | B<-t>[I<imestamp>] | B<-ts>[I<hort>] | B<-"
"n>[I<etns>] name | B<-N>[I<umeric>] | B<-a>[I<ll>] | B<-c>[I<olor>] | B<-"
"br>[I<ief>] | B<-j>[son] | B<-p>[retty] }"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr "ОПЦИИ"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-V>,B< -Version>"
msgstr "B<-V>,B< -Version>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Print the version of the B<ip> utility and exit."
msgstr "Вывести версию утилиты B<ip> и завершить работу."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-h>,B< -human>,B< -human-readable>"
msgstr "B<-h>,B< -human>,B< -human-readable>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "output statistics with human readable values followed by suffix."
msgstr ""
"Выводить статистику с удобочитаемыми значениями, за которыми следует суффикс."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-b>,B< -batch >E<lt>FILENAMEE<gt>"
msgstr "B<-b>,B< -batch >E<lt>FILENAMEE<gt>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Read commands from provided file or standard input and invoke them.  First "
"failure will cause termination of ip."
msgstr ""
"Считывать команды из предоставленного файла или со стандартного ввода и "
"вызывать их. Первая ошибка приведет к завершению работы ip."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-force>"
msgstr "B<-force>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Don't terminate ip on errors in batch mode.  If there were any errors during "
"execution of the commands, the application return code will be non zero."
msgstr ""
"Не завершать работу ip при ошибках в пакетном режиме. Если во время "
"выполнения команд возникли какие-либо ошибки, то код возврата приложения "
"будет ненулевым."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-s>,B< -stats>,B< -statistics>"
msgstr "B<-s>,B< -stats>,B< -statistics>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Output more information. If the option appears twice or more, the amount of "
"information increases.  As a rule, the information is statistics or some "
"time values."
msgstr ""
"Выводить больше информации. Если параметр появляется два раза и более,то "
"количество информации увеличивается. Как правило, информация представляет "
"собой статистику или некоторые временные значения."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-d>,B< -details>"
msgstr "B<-d>,B< -details>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Output more detailed information."
msgstr "Выводить подробную информацию."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-l>,B< -loops >E<lt>COUNTE<gt>"
msgstr "B<-l>,B< -loops >E<lt>COUNTE<gt>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Specify maximum number of loops the 'ip address flush' logic will attempt "
"before giving up. The default is 10.  Zero (0) means loop until all "
"addresses are removed."
msgstr ""
"Определить максимальное количество циклов, которые будет выполнять логика "
"\"очистки ip-адресов\", прежде чем прекратить работу. Значение по умолчанию "
"равно 10. Ноль (0) означает выполнять циклы до тех пор, пока не будут "
"удалены все адреса."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-f>,B< -family >E<lt>FAMILYE<gt>"
msgstr "B<-f>,B< -family >E<lt>FAMILYE<gt>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Specifies the protocol family to use. The protocol family identifier can be "
"one of B<inet>,B< inet6>,B< bridge>,B< mpls> or B<link>.  If this option is "
"not present, the protocol family is guessed from other arguments. If the "
"rest of the command line does not give enough information to guess the "
"family, B<ip> falls back to the default one, usually B<inet> or B<any>.  "
"B<link> is a special family identifier meaning that no networking protocol "
"is involved."
msgstr ""
"Определить семейство используемых протоколов. Идентификатор семейства "
"протоколов может быть одним из следующих: B<inet>,B< inet6>, B< bridge>, B< "
"mpls> или B<link>. Если этот параметр отсутствует, семейство протоколов "
"определяется из других аргументов. Если остальная часть командной строки не "
"предоставляет достаточно информации для определения семейства протоколов, то "
"B<ip> обычно возвращается к значению по умолчанию B<inet> или B<any>. "
"B<link> - это специальный идентификатор семейства, означающий, что сетевой "
"протокол не задействован."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-4>"
msgstr "B<-4>"

